\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-\uc2 Israel's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  to be tested in new battle to tame the shekel\b0\par\par\uc2 815 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2013\par 09:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Repeats story that ran on Wednesday with no changes)\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought estimated $100 mln of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * First \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since July 2011\par \par \uc2 * Natural gas production helping to boost shekel\par \par \uc2 By Steven Scheer\par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, April 10 (Reuters) - After standing by for months, \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  has finally run out of patience and could face a lengthy battle to rein in the shekel as Japan's massive stimulus drives funds into emerging markets.\par \par \uc2 The shekel has gained more than 5 percent over the past four months against the dollar and the euro, posing a risk to Israel's exports which account for 40 percent of economic activity.\par \par \uc2 Japan's announcement last Thursday that it planned to pump $1.4 trillion into its economy in less than two years is seen as a catalyst that will drive capital flows into higher-yielding emerging market assets, prompting \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  to step into the market on Monday for the first time since July 2011.\par \par \uc2 Japan's move and weak U.S. jobs data on Friday pushed dollar-shekel below what was believed to be a psychologically important 3.6 level for a fresh 17-month low.\par \par \uc2 Gaelle Blanchard, an emerging markets strategist at Societie Generale, said those events "changed the mood in the market."\par \par \uc2 "You see the impact in all emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Everything is booming now," she said. "People need to invest money and are trying to find a good place."\par \par \uc2 The shekel has been one of the best-performing emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, reflecting Israel's relatively strong economy and high interest rates and expectations that the start of natural gas production last month will improve the government's fiscal position.\par \par \uc2 After cutting interest rates four times last year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has kept them steady over the past three months. That suggests it will use \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as its main tool to weaken the shekel since lowering its benchmark interest rate, now at 1.75 percent, could further inflame Israeli housing prices, which have rallied 50 percent in four years.\par \par \uc2 "They are in a trap," said Tal Zohar, chief executive of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  broker FXCM Israel. "They don't want to reduce rates so not to increase the housing bubble but they want a weak shekel."\par \par \uc2 Israel's economy and finances are set to benefit from the start of natural gas production last month at the Tamar field off the Mediterranean coast, which will save the country's electricity utility the expense of having to import expensive fuels.\par \par \uc2 Natural gas production is expected to add 1 percentage point to economic growth this year, which \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  forecasts at 3.8 percent.\par \par \uc2 Tamar and the larger Leviathan field nearby, which comes online in 2016, will probably export natural gas. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has supported a finance ministry proposal to set up a sovereign wealth fund for income from the two fields to keep the shekel in check in the long run.\par \par \uc2 TEST OF RESOLVE\par \par \uc2 Israel's exports of goods, which mostly head to Europe and the United States, grew only 0.1 percent last year and leading exporters have been calling for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tame the shekel for some time.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was more of a signal than actual policy," Zohar said of Monday's action.\par \par \uc2 "What they (\uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 ) are doing is trying to push back the speculators who are weakening the dollar ... They are saying 'we are looking at it very carefully,'" he said.\par \par \uc2 Since the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar has recovered to 3.64 shekels while the euro has strengthened to 4.76 shekels from 4.66. But dealers say short-term investors have been helping drive the shekel higher and expect them to test the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve again.\par \par \uc2 "It's only a matter of time until they test the bank of Israel again," said a dealer at \uc2 Israel Discount Bank\uc2 . "It looks like each side is waiting for the other side to move."\par \par \uc2 Zohar expects dollar-shekel to move back to 3.70 in the next few months while Blanchard sees it at 3.65 at the end of June.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it "will act in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the event of unusual movements in the exchange rate which are inconsistent with the underlying economic conditions or when conditions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market are disorderly."\par \par \uc2 During its last \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  between March 2008 and July 2011 the bank bought some $50 billion of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , mainly dollars, to keep the shekel in check. Analysts doubt the current round will be so large, particularly as current \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve levels of nearly $80 billion are sufficient.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Susan Fenton)\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL-SHEKEL/ (REPEAT) | ABN | D | E | RBN | GFN | M | RNP | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130411e94b000bp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
