\par\par \b \uc2 Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  Confirms  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market Monday\b0\par\par\uc2 333 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 April 2013\par 16:54\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM--\uc2 The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Monday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the rapid rise of the shekel, confirming reports earlier in the day \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders.\par \par \uc2 The bank didn't give further details, but traders in Tel Aviv and London said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchased at least $100 million. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurred when the shekel-dollar rate dropped below ILS3.6 per dollar, which many analysts consider a threshold. Within minutes of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the rate went up to ILS3.62 per dollar. It was steady at ILS3.621 at 1500 GMT.\par \par \uc2 The bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the first since 2011 and was highly expected.\par \par \uc2 The government-backed Israel Export Institute praised the move, which it had been calling for since last week.\par \par \uc2 "This measure has proven \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 's commitments to Israeli exports and economic growth," Ramzi Gabay, chairman of the institute, said in a statement. But he said the institute still remains "deeply concerned" about the shekel and its impact on exports.\par \par \uc2 The shekel gained sharply against the dollar over the last week when Israel started production from one of its large natural gas fields. The gas production is expected to boost Israel's gross domestic product growth by 1% in 2013, with GDP expected to grow 3.8%.\par \par \uc2 The dollar was also weak in world markets Monday.\par \par \uc2 Before the bank bought the dollars Monday, a senior official there said he hoped the bank wouldn't have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "But if there is a need we will," said Barry Topf, senior advisor to bank governor \uc2 Stanley Fischer\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The bank said in statement that it maintains a policy to "act in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the event of unusual movements in the exchange rate which are inconsistent with the underlying economic conditions or when conditions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market are disorderly."\par \par \uc2 Write to Sara Toth Stub at realtimedesklondon@dowjones.com [ 08-04-13 1525GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130408e948000nh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
