\par\par \b \uc2 Israel's Deficit Widens Sharply in First Quarter\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sara Toth Stub   \par \uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 April 2013\par 15:31\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Special to \uc2 DOW JONES\uc2  NEWWIRES\par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM--\uc2 Israel's government\uc2  deficit for the first quarter nearly tripled in size compared with the previous year, the finance ministry said Monday, underscoring growing concerns among economists about the country's balance of payments.\par \par \uc2 The deficit expanded to 4.6 billion shekels ($1.27 billion) from ILS1.6 billion, the finance ministry said. Economists said the deficit was larger than expected.\par \par \uc2 "The deficit is the biggest risk to the Israeli economy now," said Alex Zabezhinsky, chief economist at DS Investment House in Tel Aviv. On Sunday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  warned that the country's growing deficit was likely to lead to higher borrowing costs.\par \par \uc2 The government is currently operating without an annual budget after elections were held earlier this year. Each month spending is limited to one-twelfth of last year's total budget until a new one is approved. Such an arrangement usually results in fiscal tightening, but the deficit has been growing due to lower revenue, Mr. Zabezhinksy said.\par \par \uc2 In 2012, the deficit totaled 4.2% of gross domestic product, well above the country's target of 2% of GDP. Even if the government cuts the proposed 2013 budget by 5%, as currently planned, the deficit for 2013 is likely to reach 3.6% of GDP, again missing the target, the bank said.\par \par \uc2 Monday's deficit data didn't weigh heavily on the stock market, which was boosted by \uc2 the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem a rising shekel, according to analysts.\par \par \uc2 Write to Sara Toth Stub at realtimedesklondon@dowjones.com [ 08-04-13 1331GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130408e948000m7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
