light\uc2  in the market several times in 2011, effectively buying billions of dollars, it drew criticism from the \uc2 Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development\uc2  and the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to Sara Toth Stub at realtimedesklondon@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 08, 2013 07:09 ET (11:09 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130408e948001qx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
