\par\par \b \uc2 Israel Industry Leaders Call on  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  to Weaken Shekel\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sara Toth Stub   \par \uc2 512 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 April 2013\par 12:38\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Special to DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM--Israeli manufacturers and exporters on Thursday continued to call on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the shekel's strength, which they say is threatening the whole economy.\par \par \uc2 Although profit-taking weakened the shekel slightly Thursday morning, it was still trading at levels not seen since 2011, a year when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times to stabilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders and economists said the start of gas production at a new gas field Sunday was the main reason for the shekel's rise this week, as it reduces the need for local shekel sales to buy dollar-denominated fuel.\par \par \uc2 In addition, a large interest rate differential with other developed countries and a relatively robust economic performance have been keeping the shekel strong since the beginning of the year.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the Manufacturers Association of Israel and government-backed Israel Export Institute said \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  should buy dollars, as it has done in the past, to help weaken the shekel. They said the strong shekel makes Israel's exports more expensive abroad, hurting the whole economy. About 40% of Israel's gross domestic product comes from exports, according to the finance ministry.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 The Bank of Israel\uc2  understands the importance of manufacturing and exports, and should use all of their tools, including \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, to make sure \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  can succeed in the world market," Ruby Ginel, the \uc2 Manufacturers Association\uc2 's deputy director of regulation and economy, told \uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He said the shekel's ideal level would be about ILS4 per dollar. "At that level customers abroad will buy our products and it's also strong enough for the local economy in Israel," Mr. Ginel said.\par \par \uc2 At 1036 GMT, the dollar was trading at ILS3.6280.\par \par \uc2 Ramzi Gabay, chairman of the Israel Export Institute also called on the bank to buy dollars.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, he added in a statement that the government needs to work on setting up the sovereign wealth fund it approved last year to invest Israel's gas revenue overseas rather than at home to prevent too strong a shekel, rapid inflation and other economic instability.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it wasn't commenting on calls to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.\par \par \uc2 Expectations of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market have been running high since Israel's Tamar gas field, which contains about 9 trillion cubic feet of natural gas, started production at the weekend.\par \par \uc2 The field is expected to add one percentage point to the growth of Israel's GDP this year. The economy is expected to grow 3.8% in 2013, taking into account the gas, most of which is earmarked for domestic consumption.\par \par \uc2 The shekel is also expected to become stronger because large companies, including the state-owned electric company, will no longer need foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase energy abroad.\par \par \uc2 Write to Sara Toth Stub at realtimedesklondon@dowjones.com [ 04-04-13 1038GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130404e944000gg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
