\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Bank of Israel buys $100 mln after rate hike\b0\par\par\uc2 By Tova Cohen   \par \uc2 551 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 2011\par 09:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, background)\par \par \uc2 TEL AVIV, Jan 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday to contain the shekel's appreciation a day after it raised its key lending rate by a quarter point to 2.25 percent.\par \par \uc2 The shekel weakened to 3.6010 per dollar after the bank stepped in and dollar buying by locals weakened the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  further to 3.6140. That compared with Monday's official rate of 3.6250, which was set before the interest rate announcement.\par \par \uc2 "They came in at 3.59 (shekels per dollar) and bought $100 million," a dealer at a large Israeli bank said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly to contain a rally in the shekel, which hit a 27-month high of 3.528 shekels per dollar earlier this month. Last week the bank also imposed a reserve requirement on some \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  derivative deals. [ID:nLDE70J1KN]\par \par \uc2 Local media has speculated more controls might be in the works, including possibly imposing a tax on capital movements. [ID:nLDE70J1KN] The Finance Ministry has declined comment on the reports.\par \par \uc2 The introduction of a reserve requirement briefly took some pressure off the shekel, giving the Bank of Israel more room to raise interest rates.\par \par \uc2 It raised its key lending rate <ILINR=ECI> by a quarter point on Monday to try and bring inflation back within target and analysts see further tightening in coming months. [ID:nLDE70N1XW]\par \par \uc2 "The interest rate hike was expected by the market," said Rony Gitlin, head of spot trading at Bank Leumi.\par \par \uc2 INFLATION PRESSURE\par \par \uc2 Ron Eichel, chief economist at Meitav Investment House, expects another quarter point rate increase in late April and sees the key rate reaching 3 percent by the end of 2011.\par \par \uc2 The rate hike was the first since September and came as rising housing prices and strong economic growth add to inflation pressure.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in a statement on Monday, said inflation measured over the previous 12 months was likely to be above the upper limit of the 1-3 percent target inflation range for most of 2011 but return to within the range towards the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Gitlin said the outlook for the shekel would depend on what further measures the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  takes to contain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rally, which threatens Israeli exports.\par \par \uc2 "The expectations are for more measures but it depends on what happens with the exchange rate," Gitlin said. "If the rate stays at about this level then maybe there won't be more measures."\par \par \uc2 After the bank imposed the reserve requirement the shekel weakened to 3.62 to the dollar from 3.56. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the reserve requirement was "expected to moderate the effect of the increase in the interest rate differentials on the strengthening of the shekel".\par \par \uc2 The imposition of a reserve requirement came after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stipulated that Israelis and foreigners must report on transactions in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps and forwards of more than $10 million in one day.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $2.3 billion of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in December, bringing its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to a record $70.9 billion. (Editing by Susan Fenton)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ISRAEL\b0 \highlight\uc2 -SHEKEL/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110125e71p000h0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
