reats to (economic) growth is the exchange rate," Fischer told a business conference, noting that exports comprise 45 percent of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economic activity. "We will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as needed." (Reporting by Tova Cohen and Steven Scheer; editing by Stephen Nisbet)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ISRAEL\b0 \highlight\uc2 -SHEKEL/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|MD|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101215e6cf000pi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
