\par\par \b \uc2 Israel cenbank buys  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  as euro-shekel gains\b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 2010\par 15:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * C. bank seen buying up to $40 mln to curb shekel\par \par \uc2 * First time seen in mkt in nearly six weeks\par \par \uc2 * Euro hits five-month low vs shekel\par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, Dec 1 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought an estimated $40 million in its first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in nearly six weeks on Wednesday, as the euro <EURILS=> hit a five-month low against the shekel, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The euro's weakness to a near 2-1/2 year low against the dollar sent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 4.7750 per shekel, its lowest point since late June.\par \par \uc2 Dealers said the Bank of Israel bought as much as $40 million, a move that pushed the euro back above 4.80. It was fixed at 4.8044, up 0.3 percent from Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 "It's not a dollar story, it's a euro story," said a dealer at a large Israeli bank. "It wasn't a lot but it was just to ... remind us that he (Bank of Israel Governor Stanley Fischer) hasn't disappeared."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was last seen buying \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Oct. 20 as the dollar hit a near two-year low against the shekel. It bought $3.375 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  in October but probably nothing in November.\par \par \uc2 About one-third of Israel's exports are to Europe, and another 30 percent go to the United States, and a strong shekel hurts exports, which comprise more than 40 percent of Israel's economic activity.\par \par \uc2 The shekel <ILS=> was fixed at 3.6650 per dollar on Wednesday, 0.5 percent weaker than on Tuesday. (Reporting by Steven Scheer; Editing by Susan Fenton)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ISRAEL\b0 \highlight\uc2 -SHEKEL/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|D|MD|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101201e6c1000zu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
