\par\par \b \uc2 Israel cenbank buys  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  again, shekel dips vs dollar\b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 2010\par 17:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, Jan 21 (Reuters) - The Bank of Israel bought foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a second straight day on Thursday, but it failed to significantly move the dollar higher against the shekel <ILS=>, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 "They bought between $100 million and $200 million," said a dealer at \uc2 Mizrahi Tefahot Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It was the seventh \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market so far in 2010 as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tries to prevent the shekel from appreciating further and hurting exports.\par \par \uc2 Dealers said the bank has switched in recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to working through brokers, making it harder to pin down the exact value of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases.\par \par \uc2 The shekel was fixed at 3.715 per dollar, down 0.3 from Wednesday's rate of 3.704. Over the first two weeks of 2010, it had appreciated as much as 3 percent to reach a 15-month high of 3.66 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Over the past two sessions, the shekel has shed 0.7 percent versus the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But dealers said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had less to do with the move as a rebound in euro-dollar.\par \par \uc2 Over the first three weeks, foreign banks had sold large amounts of dollars and bought shekels. Foreign banks, though, started buying dollars again on Wednesday, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 In late trading, the shekel was at 3.7220 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Steven Scheer; editing by Patrick Graham)\par \par \uc2 SHEKEL-\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|MD|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100121e61l001ve\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
