\par\par \b \uc2 Bank of Israel buys $30-40 mln of  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  -dealer\b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Oktober 2009\par 14:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, Oct 26 (Reuters) - The Bank of Israel bought some $30-40 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday but the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  did little to push the dollar up against the shekel shekel <ILS=>, a dealer at an Israeli bank said.\par \par \uc2 "The bank of Israel bought some $30-40 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but the amount was too small to have an effect on the market," a dealer at \uc2 Israel Discount Bank\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 The dealer's comments came as the dollar slipped to 3.68 shekels in late afternoon trade.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to announce its rate decision for November later on Monday, with a Reuters poll of analysts predicting the bank will keep its key lending rate at 0.75 percent for a second straight month.\par \par \uc2 The shekel's official rate was set at 3.69 per dollar, a fresh 10-month peak, from Friday's rate of 3.6920.\par \par \uc2 With the dollar weak around the world, the Bank of Israel has been trying to prevent the shekel from appreciating too fast since a strong local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hurts exports, which account for nearly half of Israel's economic activity.\par \par \uc2 Exports have already been damaged by the global recession.\par \par \uc2 In August, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  halted a more than year-long programme of buying $100 million a day of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and instead said it would enter the market on days of unusual activity.\par \par \uc2 The bank has said it did not target a specific dollar-shekel rate, and that its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were exceptional responses to the global crisis to keep the shekel in equilibrium.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Joseph Nasr, Editing by Patrick Graham)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ISRAEL\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|MD|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091026e5aq001au\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
